  "problem": "$(-6)^{2}=${{field-1}}",
  "worked_solution": "The expression $(-6)^{2}$ means $-6$ multiplied by itself $2$ times. So we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(-6)^{2} & =(-6)\\times (-6) \\\\  & =36.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
